DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSeats) \nMatt Rife: Stay Golde
	n World Tour LIVE at Greek Theatre\nDue to overwhelming demand\, Matt Rife
	 has added a third night at the iconic Greek Theatre in Los Angeles. The S
	tay Golden World Tour continues on Monday\, July 13\, 2026 — and this is y
	our last chance to catch him at one of LA’s most beloved outdoor amphithea
	ters. \nMatt Rife is one of the hottest comedians in the world right now\,
	 known for his sharp wit\, crowd work\, and viral social media presence th
	at has earned him tens of millions of fans globally. \nEvent Details\nDate
	: Monday\, July 13\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM PDT (Doors open at 6:00 PM) \nVe
	nue: Greek Theatre \nAddress: 2700 N Vermont Ave\, Los Angeles\, CA 90027 
	\nTour: Stay Golden World Tour \nAge Requirement: All Ages \nParking: Pref
	erred parking available via Ticketmaster add-on \nAbout Matt Rife\nMatt Ri
	fe is a stand-up comedian and social media phenomenon who rose to global f
	ame through his viral TikTok videos and sold-out tours. Known for his fear
	less crowd work and sharp observational humor\, he has become one of the f
	astest-selling touring comedians in the world. His Netflix special and mul
	tiple sold-out arena tours have cemented his status as a comedy superstar.
	 \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy from one of the world’s b
	iggest comedy stars\nLegendary crowd work and audience interaction\nBeauti
	ful outdoor amphitheater setting in Griffith Park\nThird and final night o
	f the Greek Theatre run — added due to sold-out demand\nArrive early — doo
	rs open at 6:00 PM for a 7:30 PM showtime\nOne of the most anticipated com
	edy shows of summer 2026\n\nVenue Information\nThe Greek Theatre is one of
	 Los Angeles’ most iconic outdoor amphitheaters\, nestled in Griffith Park
	 at 2700 N Vermont Ave. With a capacity of 5\,900 and stunning natural sur
	roundings\, it offers an unmatched open-air entertainment experience under
	 the stars. \nTicket Information\nTickets for Matt Rife: Stay Golden World
	 Tour at the Greek Theatre on July 13 are available now. Prices start from
	 $63 with resale options available. This is the third and final night — do
	n’t miss out! \nOfficial Tickets (Ticketmaster) \nResale Tickets (VividSea
	ts) \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purc
	hase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are fi
	nal. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entr
	y.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/matt-rife-stay-golden-world-tour-li
	ve-at-greek-theatre-july-thirteen/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/matt-rife-stay-golden-world-tour-live-
	at-greek-theatre-july-thirteen/
LOCATION:Greek Theater\, 2700 N Vermont Ave.\, Los Angeles\, CA\, 90027\, U
	nited States
