SUMMARY:John Caparulo LIVE at Jimmy Kimmel's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260713T123637Z
DTSTART:20260714T213000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nJohn Capa
	rulo is a beloved stand-up comedian known for his relatable\, self-depreca
	ting humor and everyman charm that resonates with audiences across the cou
	ntry. \nHe gained national recognition through his appearances on Chelsea 
	Lately\, The Tonight Show\, and his own Comedy Central special\, building 
	a loyal fanbase with his honest\, blue-collar comedic perspective. \nCapar
	ulo’s comedy is warm\, accessible\, and consistently hilarious — drawing o
	n his experiences as a husband\, father\, and regular guy navigating the a
	bsurdities of modern life. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Tuesday\, July 14\, 20
	26\nShow Time: 9:30 PM (doors open earlier)\nVenue: Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy 
	Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nAge Restriction: 18+ 
	Event\nTicket Prices: From $49\n\nAbout the Venue\nJimmy Kimmel’s Comedy C
	lub is one of the premier comedy destinations on the Las Vegas Strip\, loc
	ated on the iconic LINQ Promenade at 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd. \nThe intimate
	 venue seats approximately 300 guests and features a state-of-the-art soun
	d system\, excellent sightlines from every seat\, and full bar service thr
	oughout the show. \nThe club’s cozy atmosphere creates an up-close-and-per
	sonal comedy experience unlike the large arena shows Vegas is known for. P
	arking is available at the LINQ Hotel parking garage\, and the venue is ea
	sily accessible via the Las Vegas Monorail. \nThe LINQ Promenade itself of
	fers a variety of dining and entertainment options before and after the sh
	ow\, making it a perfect evening destination on the Strip. \nWhat to Expec
	t\nJohn Caparulo delivers a headline solo stand-up performance filled with
	 his trademark self-deprecating humor\, relatable family stories\, and sha
	rp observational comedy. \nExpect a warm\, laugh-out-loud show where Capar
	ulo’s natural likability and comedic timing create an effortlessly enterta
	ining evening. His sets feel like hanging out with a funny friend who happ
	ens to be a professional comedian. \nThis is a perfect show for fans of cl
	ean\, accessible comedy in an intimate Las Vegas club setting. Arrive earl
	y to grab a drink and enjoy the full experience. \nTicket Information\nTic
	kets start from $49 and are available through official and resale channels
	. \nOfficial TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. W
	e may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar
	.com/event/john-caparulo-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-comedy-club-2/\n\nFrom Come
	dy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/john-caparulo-live-at-jimmy-kimmels-co
	medy-club-2/
LOCATION:Jimmy Kimmel’s Comedy Club\, 3545 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, N
	V\, 89109\, USA
