DTSTAMP:20260713T123637Z
DTSTART:20260715T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \n“Weird Al” Yankovic: Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour LI
	VE at Mohegan Sun Arena\nThe legendary “Weird Al” Yankovic brings his spec
	tacular Bigger & Weirder 2026 Tour to Mohegan Sun Arena in Uncasville\, CT
	 on July 15\, 2026. The undisputed king of comedy music returns with an ex
	travagant live show featuring his greatest parody hits\, original songs\, 
	and jaw-dropping costume changes — one night after his Providence show! \n
	Event Details\nDate: Wednesday\, July 15\, 2026\nTime: 7:30 PM\nVenue: Moh
	egan Sun Arena\nAddress: 1 Mohegan Sun Blvd\, Uncasville\, CT 06382\nAge R
	equirement: All Ages\nTicket Prices: Starting at $81 \nAbout “Weird Al” Ya
	nkovic\n“Weird Al” Yankovic is the best-selling comedy recording artist of
	 all time\, with 5 Grammy Awards and over 12 million albums sold worldwide
	. Known for iconic parodies like “Eat It\,” “Amish Paradise\,” and “White 
	& Nerdy\,” Weird Al has been entertaining audiences for over four decades.
	 His 2022 biopic “Weird: The Al Yankovic Story” introduced him to a whole 
	new generation of fans. \nWhat to Expect\n\nA spectacular full-production 
	live show with elaborate costumes\nClassic parody hits and beloved origina
	l songs\nMultiple costume changes and theatrical set pieces\nAll-ages fami
	ly-friendly entertainment\nOne of the most unique and entertaining live sh
	ows in music and comedy\nA night of pure joy and laughter at the world-fam
	ous Mohegan Sun Arena\n\nVenue Information\nMohegan Sun Arena is one of th
	e premier entertainment venues in New England\, located at 1 Mohegan Sun B
	lvd in Uncasville\, CT. The 10\,000-seat arena is part of the world-famous
	 Mohegan Sun resort complex and offers free parking\, excellent sightlines
	\, and a world-class entertainment experience. \nTicket Information\nTicke
	ts start at $81 and are available now. This is an all-ages event. There is
	 an overall 4 ticket limit for this event. Purchase official tickets throu
	gh Ticketmaster or find resale tickets on VividSeats. \nOfficial Tickets\n
	Resale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission 
	if you purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you.\nAll sa
	les are final. Show times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be require
	d for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/weird-al-yankovic-bigger-
	weirder-tour-live-at-mohegan-sun-arena/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
